            "retrieved_supported": true,
            "context_supported": true,
            "answer_covered": true,
            "explanation": "The answer names all five components—vision, skills, incentives, resources, and an action plan—and the cited context supports checking that the team has them."
          },
          {
            "point_index": 1,
            "reference_supported": true,
            "retrieved_supported": true,
            "context_supported": true,
            "answer_covered": true,
            "explanation": "The answer says to observe the team, identify what may be missing, and choose levers to address it. The retrieved passages and provided context support that diagnostic sequence."
          },
          {
            "point_index": 2,
