            "explanation": "The reference explicitly says action plans are easier to institute and that changing vision and skills is harder. The retrieved passages and provided context say action plans are easier to institute, but do not state the comparison with vision or skills. The answer only says they are easier than “some other parts,” so it does not clearly cover the expected comparison."
          }
